After signing out and even reinstalling the app, it now won&#39;t sign me in because it says &#34;We couldn&#39;t find a Microsoft account for &lt;my email address&gt;&#34; yet when I click on &#34;Create account&#34; or &#34;Don&#39;t have a Microsoft account&#34; it says &#34;&lt;my email address&gt; is already a Microsoft account&#34;. 

What on Earth is going on?
